OL,4,CPedestrian in 90s seriously hurt in    
OL,5,Ccollision                              
OL,6,GA woman aged in her 90s has been taken 
OL,7,Gto hospital with serious injuries      
OL,8,Gfollowing a collision with a car.      
OL,10,FNorfolk Police said the incident       
OL,11,Finvolved a blue Peugeot 108 and a      
OL,12,Fpedestrian. The collision happened on  
OL,13,FUnthank Road near the junction with    
OL,14,FPark Lane in Norwich at about 16:20    
OL,15,FGMT on Wednesday and the road was      
OL,16,Freopened at 20:30.                     
OL,18,FThe East of England Ambulance Service  
OL,19,Fsaid it took one patient to the        
OL,20,FNorfolk and Norwich University         
OL,21,FHospital for treatment.                
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
