OL,4,CTrain cancellations due to 'emergency  
OL,5,Cincident'                              
OL,6,GTrain services between Stevenage and   
OL,7,GLondon have been cancelled or delayed  
OL,8,Gdue to an emergency incident.          
OL,10,FGreat Northern Rail and Thameslink     
OL,11,Fsaid emergency services are dealing    
OL,12,Fwith a situation in the Knebworth area 
OL,13,Fwhich has led to all lines between the 
OL,14,Fstations being closed.                 
OL,16,FPassengers should expect trains to be  
OL,17,Fcancelled, delayed by up to an hour,   
OL,18,For diverted via Hertford North, the    
OL,19,Frail companies said on their websites. 
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
