OL,4,CMOT for hearse that carried Diana to   
OL,5,Cbe auctioned                           
OL,6,GAn auctioneer selling a piece of       
OL,7,Gmemorabilia associated with the late   
OL,8,GPrincess Diana said interest in such   
OL,9,Gitems remained strong.                 
OL,11,FAnglia Car Auctions based in King's    
OL,12,FLynn, Norfolk, is selling the MOT      
OL,13,Fcertificate for the hearse that        
OL,14,Fcarried the Princess of Wales to her   
OL,15,Ffinal resting place at Althorp,        
OL,16,FNorthamptonshire, in September 1997.   
OL,18,FWilliam King, an auctioneer of 30      
OL,19,Fyears, said: "There doesn't seem to be 
OL,20,Fany drop off in the demand for         
OL,21,Fanything that's Diana related."        
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
